{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-034", "score": 0.083, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-034 | Study family SF-PAP-034: Position breakdown and Gobert sanity check on structural load\n- observed_research_question: Position breakdown and Gobert sanity check on structural load\n- auto_outcome_status: no result recorded\n- observed_hypothesis: Structural load is not an artifact of position or low initiation volume (Gobert vs other C/F-C; init<400 vs >=400).\n- observed_result: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: no result CSV/log of the printed tables was found\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Exploratory merge of fragility_full_loads with player_positions and initiation totals from paper2_full_edges.parquet.\n- observed_verdict: abandoned\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: Archive paper discusses Gobert as a low-usage hub but does not report this script's group means.\n- auto_confidence: low (0.15)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-155"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-088", "score": 0.082, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-088 | Study family SF-APPS-088: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- observed_research_question: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector absence displaces team offensive identity (D_A) more than usage-matched non-organizer absence.\n- observed_result: Unmatched conn vs role D_A 0.2020 vs 0.1021, t=5.97 p=2.87e-08. Usage-matched vs role: paired dD_A +0.1151, P(conn>ctrl)=81.2%, t=6.35 p=7.35e-09 n=96. Vs terminal: +0.0777 t=2.37 p=0.0261 n=25.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Usage-matched connector vs role occupant identity break is large and significant (n=96). Licensed comparison excludes organizers.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=96 matched pairs vs role; n=25 vs terminal; 908 player-seasons\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-014"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-016", "score": 0.062, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-016 | Study family SF-APPA-016: Per-team calibration: model 'signal' (bias) vs actual PPP, V1-V6\n- observed_research_question: Per-team calibration: model 'signal' (bias) vs actual PPP, V1-V6\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: A3 predicted PPP exceeds actual (treated as validated optimization signal) and is well calibrated.\n- observed_result: V1 bias +0.0112 (+1.12 pts/100), R2 -0.1758, win-side 58.8%; V2 +1.69; V3 +1.26; V6 bias -0.0012 (-0.12 pts/100), R2 0.0323, win-side 61.9%, model>actual 47.5%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: At 520 matchups / 69,876 poss the signal is -0.12 pts/100 and R2 0.03.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 520 matchups, 69,876 possessions\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-017\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-020\n- observed_method: V1-V5: 240 matchups, 23,922 poss; V6: 520 matchups, 69,876 poss (season_engines); bias, MAE, RMSE, R2, win-side accuracy."}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-074", "score": 0.062, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-074 | Study family SF-APPS-074: Gravity persistence: elite creator -> teammate PPP at lags 1-3\n- observed_research_question: Gravity persistence: elite creator -> teammate PPP at lags 1-3\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: After an elite creator's signature action, teammates score more on the team's next k possessions with the same lineup on the floor.\n- observed_result: All 8 creators horizon=0. Jokic lag-1 ATT=+0.0282 CI[-0.043,+0.099] p=0.3779. CLEAN NULL on teammate PPP. Secondary: Antetokounmpo +0.075 distinct initiators over next 3 poss (perm p=0.0002, BH 0.003) ? structure not eff [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: No elite creator produces a positive lineup-matched teammate-PPP lift at any lag.\n- observed_sample_and_power: Jokic lag-1 n=1880; Giannis n=1804; Doncic n=325\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF30\n- observed_verdict: null"}], "n_results": 4}

